// AWS EC2 Default EBS Encryption Disabled  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1562
// Detects disabling of account/region default EBS encryption (DisableEbsEncryptionByDefault), weakening data-at-rest protection for future…
// False positives: Rare, deliberate change to encryption defaults (should be reviewed).
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/ec2-disable-default-ebs-encryption.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "DisableEbsEncryptionByDefault" and eventSource =~ "ec2.amazonaws.com"
